  "What is Ranching?": "什么是牧场？",
  "Ranching is a [b]Passive[/b] Skill designed to provide important raw resources used around the game in a passive manner.\n\nIt is not designed to be the primary source of these resources, but instead be a source that can produce as you work on other Skills.": "牧场是一项[b]被动[/b]技能，旨在以被动方式提供游戏中所需的重要原材料。\n\n它并非这些资源的主要来源，而是让你训练其他技能时，也能持续获得资源。",
  "You are tasked to purchase plots of [b]Land[/b] to build [b]Enclosures[/b] and look after various types of [b]Animals[/b].\n\nEach [b]Animal[/b] has a [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b] stat that needs to be managed, where your primary goal is to keep this at or above 100%.\n\n[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]Skill XP[/b] and resources are generated every 1 hour, multiplied by [img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]Happiness[/b].": "你需要购买[b]土地[/b]，建造[b]围栏[/b]，照料各种[b]动物[/b]。\n\n每只[b]动物[/b]都有需要管理的[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]，首要目标是将其维持在 100% 或以上。\n\n每小时获得一次[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Icons/SkillIcon.png[/img] [b]技能经验[/b]和资源，数量乘以[img height=1.25em]res://Assets/Skills/AnimalHusbandry/happiness.png[/img] [b]幸福度[/b]。",
