  "Happiness: 0%": "幸福度：0%",
  "Happiness: {0:P0}": "幸福度：{0:P0}",
  "Happiness": "幸福度",
  "Happy Animals, happy farm.\n[ul]Calculated based on the three other stats.\n[b]Skill XP[/b] & [b]Produce[/b] is multiplied by the Animal's [b]Happiness[/b].\nCannot go below [color=orange]0%[/color].[/ul]\n\n[i]Happiness = Hunger * 0.3 + Comfort * 0.3 + Satisfaction * 0.4[/i]\nNote: [b]Comfort[/b] is [color=green]1[/color] if >= [color=orange]75%[/color]": "动物幸福，农场兴旺。\n[ul]由其他三项属性计算而来。\n[b]技能经验[/b]与[b]产出[/b]会乘以动物的[b]幸福度[/b]。\n最低为[color=orange]0%[/color]。[/ul]\n\n[i]幸福度 = 饱食度 * 0.3 + 舒适度 * 0.3 + 满足度 * 0.4[/i]\n注意：[b]舒适度[/b] >= [color=orange]75%[/color] 时，按[color=green]1[/color]计算",
  "Hunger: 0%": "饱食度：0%",
  "Hunger: {0:P0}": "饱食度：{0:P0}",
  "[ul]Keep your animals fed every hour.\nReduces by [color=orange]10%[/color] every hour an animal is not fed :(\nReplenish to [color=orange]100%[/color] when fed :D\nSome animals don't need food (Like Sheep or Cows).\nYour animal won't die at [color=orange]0%[/color] [b]Hunger[/b], but my goodness it will be STARVING.[/ul]": "[ul]每小时喂饱动物。\n每饿一小时就降低[color=orange]10%[/color] :(\n进食后恢复至[color=orange]100%[/color] :D\n有些动物不需要食物（例如羊或牛）。\n动物不会因[b]饱食度[/b]降至[color=orange]0%[/color]而死，但天哪，它一定饿坏了。[/ul]",
  "Comfort: 0%": "舒适度：0%",
  "Comfort: {0:P0}": "舒适度：{0:P0}",
  "[ul]Equals the [b]Maintenance[/b] value of this Enclosure.\nRepair the Enclosure to maintain this stat, simple.\nHas no effect on [b]Happiness[/b] until it falls below [color=orange]75%[/color][/ul]": "[ul]等于围栏的[b]维护状态[/b]。\n修理围栏即可维持这项属性，就是这么简单。\n低于[color=orange]75%[/color]时才会影响[b]幸福度[/b]。[/ul]",
