  "< Return to Ranch": "< 返回牧场",
  "Hold to Yeet Animal": "按住放走动物",
  "Yeet Animal": "放走动物",
  "[color=#E9DFC1]Thank you for joining us during [color=FFD16D]Steam Next Fest[/color]!\n\nMelvor Idle 2 is still in active development, and the version you're about to play is an [color=FFD16D]early limited look at the game[/color]. Many systems, features, visuals, and balance are still being developed and refined as we work towards an Early Access release.\n\nFor this demo, progression is limited to [color=FFD16D]Level 60[/color], with only a limited selection of Skills and content available to test out. The Early Access release will have far more content available!\n\nAs this is an early build, you may encounter unfinished content, balance that isn't quite right, missing features, or bugs.\n\nYour feedback during Next Fest is incredibly valuable to us. We'd love to hear about your experience, any bugs you may have encountered, or general discussions around the game.\n\nMost importantly, have fun, explore, experiment, and enjoy your first steps into Melvor Idle 2!\n\nAnd remember - [color=FFD16D]Melvor Idle 2 is an idle game![/color] You can set your character on a task, let them make progress in the background, and check out some of the other great games taking part in Steam Next Fest. Melvor will be here when you get back!\n\nThank you for being part of the journey![/color]\n\n- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs, Coolrox, Prat, Tapi & Ash[/color][/i]": "[color=#E9DFC1]感谢你在[color=FFD16D]Steam 新品节[/color]期间加入我们！\n\nMelvor Idle 2 仍在积极开发中，你即将体验的版本只是[color=FFD16D]游戏的早期有限预览[/color]。我们正为抢先体验版做准备，许多系统、功能、画面及平衡仍在持续开发与完善。\n\n本试玩版的进度上限为[color=FFD16D]60 级[/color]，仅开放部分技能与内容供体验。抢先体验版将提供丰富得多的内容！\n\n由于这是早期版本，你可能遇到未完成内容、不够完善的平衡、缺失功能或错误。\n\n新品节期间，你的反馈对我们十分宝贵。我们希望听到你的体验、遇到的错误，以及任何关于游戏的讨论。\n\n最重要的是，尽情游玩、探索、尝试，享受你在 Melvor Idle 2 中迈出的第一步！\n\n也请记住：[color=FFD16D]Melvor Idle 2 是一款放置游戏！[/color]你可以安排角色执行任务，让其在后台取得进展，然后去体验其他参加 Steam 新品节的优秀游戏。回来时，梅尔沃依然在这里等你！\n\n感谢你参与这段旅程！[/color]\n\n- [i][color=light_gray]Malcs, Coolrox, Prat, Tapi & Ash[/color][/i]",
